{number: 48}
{title: Since Jesus Came Into My Heart}
{key: Ab}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Ab] What a wonderful change in my life has been wrought
Since Jesus came into my [Eb7] heart!
I have [Ab] light in my soul for which [Db] long I had sought,
Since Jesus came [Eb7] into my [Ab] heart!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Since Jesus came [Db] into my [Ab] heart,
Since Jesus came into my [Eb7] heart,
Floods of [Ab] joy o'er my soul like the [Db] sea billows roll,
Since Jesus came [Eb7] into my [Ab] heart.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
I have [Ab] ceased from my wand'ring and going astray,
Since Jesus came into my [Eb7] heart!
And my [Ab] sins, which were many, are [Db] all washed away,
Since Jesus came [Eb7] into my [Ab] heart!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
I'm pos-[Ab] sessed of a hope that is steadfast and sure,
Since Jesus came into my [Eb7] heart!
And no [Ab] dark cloud of doubting my [Db] path can obscure,
Since Jesus came [Eb7] into my [Ab] heart!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
There is [Ab] light in the valley of death now for me,
Since Jesus came into my [Eb7] heart!
And the [Ab] gates of the City be-[Db] yond I can see,
Since Jesus came [Eb7] into my [Ab] heart!
{end_of_verse}
